  "scope": "Read-only authoring asset gate, exact ownership/reference closure, frozen policy budgets and provenance coverage. SC1 stage exit remains B6.",
  "implementation": [
    "verify:assets3d scans framework stage3d, package 3d data and exact owned bundles; package author inputs are included in provenance and size accounting. Source, metadata and symlink/layout rules fail closed.",
    "PNG CRC/decompression/size policy, Radiance HDR scanlines and GLB binary/accessor/mesh/skin/image-URI structure are validated. Model and image subMeta/import options use Creator 3.8.8 fields/defaults.",
    "Texture usage, color-space declarations, sampling and compression presets are checked, including explicit mipmaps and PNG fallback. Known material slots and glTF textures must match their color-space role.",
    "B7 UUID/reference core is reused directly. Actual HDR image@cube@face subMeta nesting is supported with immediate-parent UUID validation; same-owner split bundles work, unresolved/cross-owner/host references and fake builtins fail.",
    "Six SC0 exceptions migrate to exact path/UUID/source hashes; the LightFX sampling exception also pins metadata hash and texture UUID. Existing Creator builtin allowlist is unchanged.",
    "Frozen triangle, bone and byte budgets are enforced per model/package. Retained source BIN allocation is reported separately from measured CPU memory. License coverage and acyclic source/derivative mappings are mandatory.",
    "Command, verify:core aggregation, client test entry, independent toolchain pins, AGENTS/CLAUDE/README and capability inventory are registered together."
  ],
